VALUES ('coc-dc-2017:section-11-4b', 'coc-dc-2017', 'Doctrine and Covenants', 11, 10, 'and no one can assist in this work except he shall be humble and full of love, having faith, hope, and charity, being temperate in all things whatsoever shall be intrusted to his care.', 'standard')
